[20.692567, "o", "7. Test language detection on the following 10 test samples and save results to '\"'\"'/app/detection_results.json'\"'\"':\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[20.692708, "o", "Note: The merged model will be evaluated for accuracy and must achieve at least 95% accuracy on a hidden multilingual test set (at least 75% per-language accuracy).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[20.692817, "o", "You are not allowed to know the exact class IDs, directly use the argmax of the model'\"'\"'s output logits as the predicted_class_id.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[20.692824, "o", "> "]
